# moot: this participant's own state. It travels with .moot/ and touches
# nothing of the host's .gitignore.
seen/
name
room
# A room that is a link is this machine's: add each one by name, with no
# trailing slash (a link is not a directory to git), e.g.
# rooms/dev
# A room that is a real directory may be committed, so rooms/ is not ignored.
